    {
      "message_id": 1750950327,
      "author": "Timothy Giese",
      "date_raw": "Thu, 26 Jun 2025 15:05:27 +0000",
      "body": "I confirmed the symptom with the latest main branch commit to the xtb project, and I was able to get it to compile by adding -DWITH_TBLITE=OFF to the xtb cmake configuration line. -Tim",
